{"title": "Hellish Resistance", "pageid": 4741, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hellish_Resistance", "categories": ["Racial features", "Passive features", "Applies to Wild Shape"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Hellish_Resistance.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Hellish_Resistance.webp/300px-Hellish_Resistance.webp, /w/images/b/bd/Hellish_Resistance.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Hellish_Resistance.webp/300px-Hellish_Resistance.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Hellish_Resistance.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Hellish Resistance</b> is a passive feature that grants <a href=\"/wiki/Tiefling\" title=\"Tiefling\">Tieflings</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Types#Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Types\">Resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage from magical and non-magical sources.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Your blood protects you from flame, abyssal or otherwise. Gain <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Types#Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Types\">Resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage, taking only half damage from it. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Tiefling\" title=\"Tiefling\">Tiefling</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\">Alfira</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Amek\" title=\"Amek\">Amek</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Arabella\" title=\"Arabella\">Arabella</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Archivist\" title=\"Archivist\">Archivist</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Arka\" title=\"Arka\">Arka</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Asharak\" title=\"Asharak\">Asharak</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bex\" title=\"Bex\">Bex</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ca%C3%AFros\" title=\"Caïros\">Caïros</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cal\" title=\"Cal\">Cal</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cerys\" title=\"Cerys\">Cerys</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Chell\" title=\"Chell\">Chell</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Corniche\" title=\"Corniche\">Corniche</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dairow_Vin\" title=\"Dairow Vin\">Dairow Vin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Damays\" title=\"Damays\">Damays</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dammon\" title=\"Dammon\">Dammon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Danis\" title=\"Danis\">Danis</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Danton\" title=\"Danton\">Danton</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Tiefling\" title=\"Dead Tiefling\">Dead Tiefling</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Doni\" title=\"Doni\">Doni</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Donner\" title=\"Donner\">Donner</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Elegis\" title=\"Elegis\">Elegis</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ellyka\" title=\"Ellyka\">Ellyka</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Eramas\" title=\"Eramas\">Eramas</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fevrokis\" title=\"Fevrokis\">Fevrokis</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gan\" title=\"Gan\">Gan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gerson\" title=\"Gerson\">Gerson</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Griska\" title=\"Griska\">Griska</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Guex\" title=\"Guex\">Guex</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hellrider_Cleric\" title=\"Hellrider Cleric\">Hellrider Cleric</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hellrider_Paladin\" title=\"Hellrider Paladin\">Hellrider Paladin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Honest_Vendor\" title=\"Honest Vendor\">Honest Vendor</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ide\" title=\"Ide\">Ide</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ikaron\" title=\"Ikaron\">Ikaron</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kaldani\" title=\"Kaldani\">Kaldani</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kameros\" title=\"Kameros\">Kameros</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kanon\" title=\"Kanon\">Kanon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kavil\" title=\"Kavil\">Kavil</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kivak\" title=\"Kivak\">Kivak</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Komira\" titl